        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THIS GAME CONTAINS FLASHING LIGHTS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape The Wojak GOTY is a fun, wacky game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109830/extras/f19ab8402e8e076605f4d195c98cbf12.poster.avif?t=1775440614\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109830/extras/f19ab8402e8e076605f4d195c98cbf12.webm?t=1775440614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109830/extras/f19ab8402e8e076605f4d195c98cbf12.mp4?t=1775440614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape The Wojak GOTY is a First-Person Single player 3d platformer where you TRAverse through increasingly challenging levels as fast as you can, or take your time to discover the secrets around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the original game was limited a grappling hook and speed boosts Escape The Wojak GOTY introduces a host of fresh platforming mechanics to keep the levels interesting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is one, it's something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's new?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compared to the original game Escape The Wojak GOTY features more than 10 new levels with multiple endings and extensive secrets to be found plus other features like Saving, Controller support, Options, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Original soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Ten plus levels perfect for Speedrunning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Responsive platforming controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Controller support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Multiple endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Plenty of secrets to be found</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•A short but sweet ~1 Hour main campaign</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Massive improvements over the original game in almost all areas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THIS GAME CONTAINS FLASHING LIGHTS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape The Wojak GOTY is a fun, wacky game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109830/extras/f19ab8402e8e076605f4d195c98cbf12.poster.avif?t=1775440614\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109830/extras/f19ab8402e8e076605f4d195c98cbf12.webm?t=1775440614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109830/extras/f19ab8402e8e076605f4d195c98cbf12.mp4?t=1775440614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape The Wojak GOTY is a First-Person Single player 3d platformer where you TRAverse through increasingly challenging levels as fast as you can, or take your time to discover the secrets around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the original game was limited a grappling hook and speed boosts Escape The Wojak GOTY introduces a host of fresh platforming mechanics to keep the levels interesting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is one, it's something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's new?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compared to the original game Escape The Wojak GOTY features more than 10 new levels with multiple endings and extensive secrets to be found plus other features like Saving, Controller support, Options, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Original soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Ten plus levels perfect for Speedrunning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Responsive platforming controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Controller support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Multiple endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Plenty of secrets to be found</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•A short but sweet ~1 Hour main campaign</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Massive improvements over the original game in almost all areas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "The Wojaks are advancing, run. This high-action, story-based, 3d platformer puts your skills to the test. Traverse the diverse selection of levels, grapple around, and uncover the secrets hidden behind every corner.",
